<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Terms of Service · Socio</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script>
    (function () {
      var saved = null;
      try { saved = localStorage.getItem('socio-theme'); } catch (e) {}
      if (saved === 'dark' || (!saved && window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches)) {
        document.documentElement.classList.add('dark');
      }
    })();
    window.toggleTheme = function () {
      var el = document.documentElement;
      var dark = el.classList.toggle('dark');
      try { localStorage.setItem('socio-theme', dark ? 'dark' : 'light'); } catch (e) {}
    };
  </script>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            bg: 'rgb(var(--bg) / <alpha-value>)',
            surface: 'rgb(var(--surface) / <alpha-value>)',
            'surface-2': 'rgb(var(--surface-2) / <alpha-value>)',
            input: 'rgb(var(--input) / <alpha-value>)',
            border: 'rgb(var(--border) / <alpha-value>)',
            text: 'rgb(var(--text) / <alpha-value>)',
            muted: 'rgb(var(--muted) / <alpha-value>)',
            faint: 'rgb(var(--faint) / <alpha-value>)',
            accent: 'rgb(var(--accent) / <alpha-value>)',
            'accent-fg': 'rgb(var(--accent-fg) / <alpha-value>)',
            ok: { bg: 'rgb(var(--ok-bg) / <alpha-value>)', fg: 'rgb(var(--ok-fg) / <alpha-value>)' },
            warn: { bg: 'rgb(var(--warn-bg) / <alpha-value>)', fg: 'rgb(var(--warn-fg) / <alpha-value>)' },
            err: { bg: 'rgb(var(--err-bg) / <alpha-value>)', fg: 'rgb(var(--err-fg) / <alpha-value>)' },
            info: { bg: 'rgb(var(--info-bg) / <alpha-value>)', fg: 'rgb(var(--info-fg) / <alpha-value>)' }
          }
        }
      }
    };
  </script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/theme.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-bg text-text min-h-screen flex flex-col">
  <header class="border-b border-border bg-bg/80 backdrop-blur">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <a href="/" class="font-display font-bold text-xl tracking-tight">socio<span class="text-faint">.dev</span></a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <button type="button" onclick="toggleTheme()" aria-label="Toggle dark mode" title="Toggle dark mode" class="icon-btn">
          <svg class="theme-icon-sun w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/>
            <path stroke-linecap="round" d="M12 2v2m0 16v2M4.9 4.9l1.4 1.4m11.4 11.4 1.4 1.4M2 12h2m16 0h2M4.9 19.1l1.4-1.4m11.4-11.4 1.4-1.4"/>
          </svg>
          <svg class="theme-icon-moon w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 12.8A9 9 0 1 1 11.2 3a7 7 0 0 0 9.8 9.8z"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <a href="/login" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Sign in</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="flex-1 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-14 w-full">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="micro mb-10">Last updated: 2026-08-11</p>

    <div class="space-y-10 text-[15px] text-muted leading-7">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-text text-lg tracking-tight mb-2">1. Acceptance</h2>
        <p>By using socio.dev ("the Service"), you agree to these Terms of Service. The Service is a private social-media scheduling tool; access is limited to users explicitly granted an account.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-text text-lg tracking-tight mb-2">2. Access</h2>
        <p>Accounts are provisioned individually by the Service operator. You may not share credentials, attempt to access other users' accounts, or bypass access controls. The operator may revoke access at any time without notice.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-text text-lg tracking-tight mb-2">3. Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>You agree to use the Service lawfully and in compliance with the policies of the third-party platforms it integrates with (including LinkedIn, Meta, Google, and TikTok). You are responsible for the content you schedule, including its accuracy, rights, and compliance with applicable law.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-text text-lg tracking-tight mb-2">4. Third-party services</h2>
        <p>The Service integrates with third-party APIs. Their availability, terms, and data practices are governed by their own terms of service and privacy policies. The Service makes no guarantee that any integration continues to function.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-text text-lg tracking-tight mb-2">5. No warranty</h2>
        <p>The Service is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, express or implied. Posts may fail to publish, be delayed, or be rejected by third-party platforms.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-text text-lg tracking-tight mb-2">6. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, the operator is not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from use of the Service, including missed or failed publications.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-text text-lg tracking-tight mb-2">7. Changes</h2>
        <p>These terms may be updated from time to time. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-border py-5 text-center text-xs text-faint">
    socio · <a href="/terms" class="link">Terms of Service</a> · <a href="/privacy" class="link">Privacy Policy</a>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
